#ASSERT `the cost difference chapter י"א of 30.12.2009 equalises` (3%) FALSE EQUALS 0

`the earliest agreement chapter י"א of 30.12.2009 reaches back to` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 3 3 1999

-- י"ב: the terms the parties set before stand; this agreement adds to or
